/Content/Developers/

# Nested/duplicate Unreal projects that don't belong in this repo (a full
# second copy of this game under SOTM/, Epic's MetaHuman sample project, and
# a raw MetaHuman import package). NOTE: as of 2026-09-16 these are already
# committed in git history (~8.4 GB across 7,261 tracked files) - adding
# these lines only stops new changes under them from being staged again. It
# does NOT remove them from history or shrink the repo; that needs a
# deliberate `git rm -r --cached` (or a history rewrite) - see CLEANUP.md.
/SOTM/
/MetaHumans/
/AtrisLA-7745294f/

